"P2468815394" "That Which Seeks"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4128676725" "We are inevitable!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1268837290" "We hunger, and we hunt!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P214887333" "Search leader"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1398974488" "They are slow and stupid! We can win this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3345147369" "Glory in battle!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4042010854" "Should we give our lives for a silly scroll?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2670562270" "Sir, the scroll means great power!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2690125000" "To battle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3510173887" "On one of the defeated Warriors, you found some written orders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3274225473" "So the Warriors were there searching for this Scroll of Tielekku? My guess is that the Banished Pantheon may have been searching for the same thing."
// RandomFameString :
"P340542609" "I heard that {HeroName} found a clue to something big involving the Banished Pantheon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P47568178" "I did a bit of digging about that warehouse where you stopped the Banished Pantheon and the Warriors. Apparently it's used to hold items for estates that are under dispute by the inheritors. Among other things, it held the private library of Ross Coldwell, who used to adventure with the Midnight Squad under the name Darkvine. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It might be a good idea to check with the executor of the estate and see what he knows about this Scroll of Tielekku.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P697440092" "Talk to the executor of the estate about the Scroll of Tielekku"
// SendOffString :
"P2451754335" "Darkvine was one of the many Midnight Squad members killed in the Rikti War. Like all of them, he was well versed in the mystic arts. Perhaps the Banished Pantheon and the Warriors have good reason for being interested in his belongings."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3578454195" "Find the estate manager"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2205074551" "Find the executor of the Coldwell estate. We need to know what the Banished Pantheon and the Warriors were after."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3568799625" "This staid office is in an uproar as the walking dead and their mad masters stalk its halls!"
