// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1334112634" "Hostage"
// SingularDescription :
"P3578770609" "Save the last worker!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P885491186" "I thought I was done for! I've heard what those things do to people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3928461964" "You defeated the Banished Pantheon and rescued the estate manager."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3764378581" "The Warriors already made off with the Scroll of Tielekku, huh? At least the Banished Pantheon doesn't have it, though I don't really want to see it in the Warriors' hands either. {HeroName}, we're going to have to recover that scroll."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1595930943" "Just because the Warriors got to the Scroll of Tielekku before you did doesn't mean it's all over. We'll just have to go after it. According to one of my contacts, the Warriors are near Talos Island waiting for reinforcements. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you're up to it, you could recover that scroll from the Warriors before it disappears forever.</a> I'll call for an emergency force field to give you time to get there."
// AcceptString :
"P4025861655" "Recover the scroll from the Warriors"
// SendOffString :
"P2129873546" "I still don't know what this is about, but that Scroll of Tielekku is clearly important to both the Warriors and the Banished Pantheon. Be careful."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3134843022" "Recover the Scroll of Tielekku"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1279255903" "We need to get that scroll back from the Warriors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P1337699226" "Plato's Key"
// EntryString :
"P4238272819" "You wonder what secrets the Scroll of Tielekku contains. Whatever they are, you can't let the Warriors unlock them."
