"P1173221180" "You've found the Scroll of Tielekku!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1613397233" "You have recovered the Scroll of Tielekku."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4149876599" "You got the Scroll of Tielekku! Good work. The scroll itself is still a mystery, though. I still have no idea why everyone wants the thing. I talked to the executor of Coldwell's will, as well as both of his heirs. None of them remember Coldwell even mentioning the Scroll of Tielekku. Maybe the Pantheon and the Warriors know something he didn't?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3622590989" "I've found someone who may be able to tell us why the Pantheon and the Warriors are so interested in this scroll. You may already know of Dr. Cheng; he's an old man who's very learned about all kinds of mystical matters. He says that he may be able to translate the scroll. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you deliver the Scroll of Tielekku to Dr. Cheng?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3165632345" "Deliver the Scroll of Tielekku to Dr. Cheng"
// SendOffString :
"P2505761282" "If Dr. Cheng can translate that scroll, he could finally tell us why the Banished Pantheon and the Warriors are so interested in it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3002931818" "Take the scroll to Dr. Cheng"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P192613841" "Get that scroll to Dr. Cheng, and we may be able to get some answers."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P281559296" "The scroll!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1268394578" "It is good to see you, {HeroName}. Is this the Scroll of Tielekku? Ah, yes. I would like to provide you the answers you seek, but I will first need some reference materials. Fortunately, I know exactly where to find them. Unfortunately, the information I need is held by the Circle of Thorns in one of their underground libraries. If we are to uncover the secrets of this scroll, you will have to recover several tomes from the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2321464685" "Recover tomes from Circle"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P702406245" "If you can get those books to Dr. Cheng, he can probably translate the Scroll of Tielekku. Then we can figure out what all this is about!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P210903679" "The smell of old books mingles with the strange odors of the Circle's spell components."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2566479356" "Now, where did I put that tome?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3257673964" "Tielekku! To even imagine such power shakes me deeply."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2766368520" "We shall keep this situation well in hand!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1004942534" "If those Pantheon cultists only understood the repercussions of their acts."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P186354291" "Dwell not upon the mad machinations of zealots."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P22530610" "They seek to break the seals, and we shall stop them."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1966167988" "I wonder where the Pantheon cultists will attempt the breakthrough?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P187166713" "They shall attempt to pierce the barrier in Astoria, no doubt."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2581951539" "Your interference will only make matters worse, fool!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1762306800" "I feel the barriers weakening. The city's defenders are powerless."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3186461606" "It shall be up to us in the end, as we always knew."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4148849672" "Your interference is unnecessary and ill-advised."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2500890407" "But if Tielekku still exists, what then of Ermeeth?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2578712398" "It is only a supposition, and one posited by zealots or amateurs."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P655974819" "You do not know what you face!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P759676071" "Tomefinder Arhazen"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2393419316" "There is time yet before the cultists will begin their work."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1796916008" "You have wandered far for a lost cause. You are powerless before what comes, and we alone can stop the Pantheon."

