// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P184065842" "Take the books to Dr. Cheng"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3239351080" "You got the books? Excellent! Now you've got to get them to Dr. Cheng."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P338627218" "Ah, I knew you would come through. Let me take those from you. I have already made a little headway, and have found some very interesting things. This scroll is a chronicle of the life of the goddess Tielekku, who was said to be the first to discover magic. I will be able to tell you more shortly. In the meantime, I believe {ContactName} is looking for you. It seems there has been another development."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P585923570" "Thanks for getting those reference materials to Dr. Cheng. As soon as he translates the Scroll of Tielekku, we'll know a lot more about the Banished Pantheon's intentions. You say even the Circle mystics were eager to stop the Pantheon's plot? Interesting. And not a little scary."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1771899014" "While you were helping Dr. Cheng, I got a call from the Coldwell estate manager. He hasn't been able to contact either of the Coldwell heirs for several hours, and he's getting worried about them. If the Banished Pantheon is interested in the Scroll of Tielekku that was part of Coldwell's estate, they may be interested in the heirs as well! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you rescue the Coldwell heirs from the Banished Pantheon?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P1011109444" "Save the Coldwell heirs from the Banished Pantheon"
// SendOffString :
"P299990373" "You're looking for Coldwell's daughter, Debbie Coldwell, and Dr. Duncan Silver, Coldwell's illegitimate son."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4069587441" "Rescue Coldwell heirs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1175658036" "You need to get the Coldwell heirs away from the Pantheon cultists. That's your only concern in this one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3105979889" "The distant beat of drums makes the presence of the Banished Pantheon all too clear."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3103207222" "Ravage!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P1984733676" "Feast!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P1274532826" "Debbie Coldwell"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P165876302" "You psychos!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1048506258" "Avalanche Shaman"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2110810298" "Eat of them, Lughebu!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P2862596341" "Those cultists are crazy! Can you get me out of here?"
// Script Variable SayOnArrival :
"P973283016" "Thanks. I won't forget this."
// Script Variable SayOnRecapture :
"P3411138751" "I've been recaptured!"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P82284062" "You saved me!"
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P2057609954" "Hey, wait up!"
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveText :
"P2332114736" "heirs to rescue"
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveTextSingular :
"P3014098004" "Rescue Debbie!"
// Script Variable LeadToObjectiveText :
"P3375481712" "heirs to lead out"
// Script Variable LeadToObjectiveTextSingular :
"P2154211009" "Lead Debbie out!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Debbie 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P4208769147" "Duncan Silver"
