"P2306719545" "Thanks, {Rescuer}! Let me tell you what happened!"
// Script Variable SayOnArrival :
"P2443855036" "You've saved me. I don't know how to thank you."
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P2568205353" "Thank you for saving me!"
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P1591482762" "Wait, will you?"
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveTextSingular :
"P1463471711" "Rescue Duncan!"
// Script Variable LeadToObjectiveTextSingular :
"P4063615368" "Lead Duncan out!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Duncan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3657067751" "You rescued the Coldwell heirs from the Banished Pantheon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3492209261" "Both of the Coldwell heirs are safe, thanks to you. At least the experience seems to have mellowed them out some. The executor tells me they started speaking civilly to one another on the way to the hospital. Which is good for them, but I'm a little worried, {HeroName}. The Pantheon didn't do anything to the heirs. No ritual, no sacrifice, nothing. Could it be that this kidnapping was merely a stunt to distract us from the Pantheon's real goal: the Scroll of Tielekku?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4018884304" "I just got word from Dr. Cheng. He finished the translation, but while you were rescuing the Coldwell heirs, the Pantheon jumped him and got the scroll! Cheng himself is okay, but he says it's imperative that we recover the Scroll of Tielekku at once. He's used a little of his magic and a lot of his contacts to uncover its location. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now we just need you to recover the scroll.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P44476815" "Recover the scroll"
// SendOffString :
"P3040837964" "Based on Cheng's translation, this scroll looks pretty powerful. I wonder if the Banished Pantheon really knows what they're getting into?"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P595352673" "We need to get that scroll back before the Pantheon can use it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P484067791" "The air is filled with a tangible burning anger. This place is consecrated to hate."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P829431006" "Totem of M'Teru"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P166530894" "When comes the prey?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2209060679" "Into the hunter's maw you step."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScrollOfTielekku 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P190579024" "Ancient Chest"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3719237835" "You carefully open the chest."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P926935749" "You've opened the chest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P926557434" "Here's Cheng's translation of the Scroll of Tielekku. You might want to take a moment to look at it so you have an idea of what the stakes are."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4114086185" "You have recovered the Scroll of Tielekku from the Banished Pantheon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2798267829" "You got the Scroll of Tielekku back from the Banished Pantheon? Good. We may have a chance now, but something tells me this isn't over yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2297557086" "Azuria's just alerted me to a massive buildup of mystical power in a building in Talos Island. It's got to be the Banished Pantheon. I know you got the Scroll of Tielekku back, but what if the Pantheon had it long enough to translate it? With that info, they may still be able to perform the calling ritual and trap the goddess Tielekku. If that happens, the gods of the Banished Pantheon will gain astronomical power. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to stop that ceremony before the Banished Pantheon can finish it.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P970853466" "Stop the ritual before the Banished Pantheon can finish it"
// SendOffString :
"P949594565" "According to Dr. Cheng, the Pantheon needs an altar and nine mystical gates to complete the ritual. You should be able to modify the gates and altar so they'll call to Tielekku instead of forcing her into a trap."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1431516934" "Stop the Pantheon ceremony"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3539651715" "You need to modify all nine gates and the altar to stop the ceremony."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P281041649" "This is it. You will now face the fury of the mad cult's dread gods, to save a goddess long lost to time and history."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1319810425" "Blade King Caesar"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2751718984" "C'mon! We win and we'll have a goddess at our command!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1418241220" "I fear no one! None can stand before Blade King Caesar!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3039355089" "Spell Breaker Hanuzeth"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1075437918" "We can still take advantage of this situation and gain the power of the goddess."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1117897251" "Why must you meddle in affairs which are beyond you?"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P405823289" "Lu...ghe...bu..."
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2330959999" "No interruptions!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2402074123" "Guardian Spirit of Sorrow"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2738162887" "Cry for the fate of the goddess!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2450877770" "Cry for the fate of your souls!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1967583484" "Guardian Spirit of Pain"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4079932937" "Tielekku shall anguish in eternity!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3170553064" "Eternal pain will be your reward!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1522304755" "Guardian Spirit of Desire"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1136836524" "Tielekku will long for release from her torment!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3107349112" "You shall be denied all you seek!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4725029" "Guardian Spirit of Death"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2540903214" "Death shall claim Tielekku!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1668922148" "Death shall claim your lives!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4147295285" "Guardian Totem"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4290124534" "Tielekku shall free the sleeper."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3050243699" "You cannot stop us."

