"P69902702" "You've finished your changes to the portal."
// InteractActionString :
"P2861367797" "Changing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4113533722" "You have changed this portal as the scroll described."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Case 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2568780613" "Makeshift altar"
// Description :
"P551667004" "Change altar!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P259831254" "You begin to reposition the candles on the altar."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1170861996" "You've finished repositioning the candles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4056038855" "You have changed the altar as the scroll described."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2651159336" "It is done. You've changed the Banished Pantheon's trap into a warning to the ancient goddess Tielekku."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P711136644" "You did it! The Banished Pantheon's trap is broken. People may not know it, but the city owes you big today. Maybe even the world. If the Pantheon had managed to trap the goddess Tielekku, who knows what kind of powers they might have gained?<br><br>I wonder if Tielekku got the message you sent her? Maybe, if she still exists, she'll return one day to join the fight against the Pantheon she banished to the spirit world all those eons ago.<br><br>Anyway, the Coldwell heirs seem to have made up. Coldwell's old library will be donated to the Midnight Squad, and they've given Duncan permission to  research his father's old books to his heart's content. And Dr. Cheng wanted me to thanks you for recovering his books from the Circle of Thorns; he says that they're giving him a lot of insight into the beliefs of the Tsoo. You really came through on this, {HeroName}. You were incredible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P1145207968" "I heard Azuria over at MAGI say that {HeroName} may have just saved the world from the Banished Pantheon."
